    <bpmn:process id="W_W4212" name="W4212. Partner, Association &amp; Sponsored-Event Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sponsorship decision (W4194); association opportunity
Frequency: Per sponsorship
Volume: Industry associations (e.g., constructors&#x27; associations), sponsored events, CSR events
Owner: Event Marketing Manager / Public Affairs (VS-104) / Marketing (VS-14)
Participants: Public Affairs (VS-104), Marketing (VS-14), Govt Affairs (VS-104), CSR/ESG (VS-25), Trade Sales
Source: workflow W4212 — Partner, Association &amp; Sponsored-Event Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4212_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4212_Lane1" name="Event Marketing Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4212_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4212_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4212_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4212_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4212_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4212_Start3" name="Sponsorship decision (W4194); association opportunity">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4212_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4212_Task4" name="Event Marketing/Public Affairs assess sponsorship/partnership opportunities…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Event Marketing/Public Affairs assess sponsorship/partnership opportunities (industry association, trade body, sponsored event, CSR links to VS-25) for fit, audience, and brand/relationship value
Responsible (R): Event Marketing Mgr / Public Affairs
Accountable (A): Event Marketing Mgr
Duration: Per opportunity</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4212_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4212_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4212_Task5" name="Event Marketing/Public Affairs structure the sponsorship (rights, branding…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Event Marketing/Public Affairs structure the sponsorship (rights, branding, speaking, lead-list, ABC compliance VS-86.3 — esp. if govt/association links to VS-104/VS-46), and execute BuildRight&#x27;s presence
Responsible (R): Event Marketing Mgr / Public Affairs / Legal
Accountable (A): Event Marketing Mgr
Duration: Per sponsorship</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4212_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4212_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4212_Task6" name="Event Marketing measure sponsorship ROI (brand reach, relationships, leads)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Event Marketing measure sponsorship ROI (brand reach, relationships, leads), manage the association relationship, and report (W4216)
Responsible (R): Event Marketing Mgr / Public Affairs
