    <bpmn:process id="W_W4216" name="W4216. Event Performance, ROI &amp; Portfolio Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Post-event; monthly/quarterly portfolio review
Frequency: Post-event + monthly/quarterly
Volume: All events × portfolio metrics
Owner: Event Marketing Manager / Analytics (VS-28) / Finance (VS-17.4)
Participants: Analytics (VS-28), Finance (VS-17.4), Trade Sales (VS-11/VS-107), Insights (VS-44), CMO
Source: workflow W4216 — Event Performance, ROI &amp; Portfolio Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4216_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4216_Lane1" name="Event Marketing Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4216_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4216_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4216_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4216_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4216_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4216_Start3" name="Post-event; monthly/quarterly portfolio review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4216_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4216_Task4" name="Event Marketing/Analytics measure event performance vs objectives (W4200) —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Event Marketing/Analytics measure event performance vs objectives (W4200) — leads, qualified %, meetings, cost-per-lead, pipeline/sales attributed, NPS/brand-lift, attendance vs target
Responsible (R): Event Marketing Mgr / Analytics
Accountable (A): Event Marketing Mgr
Duration: Post-event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4216_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4216_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4216_Task5" name="Event Marketing/Finance compute event ROI (attributed revenue vs total cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Event Marketing/Finance compute event ROI (attributed revenue vs total cost incl. co-fund W4197), and portfolio-level cost-per-lead/ROI across all events
Responsible (R): Event Marketing Mgr / Finance
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: Monthly/quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4216_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4216_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4216_Task6" name="Event Marketing/CMO feed learnings into the portfolio/calendar (W4194)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Event Marketing/CMO feed learnings into the portfolio/calendar (W4194), reallocate budget to high-ROI events, and report to executive/marketing governance (VS-14/VS-33)
Responsible (R): Event Marketing Mgr / CMO
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4216_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4216_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4216_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4216_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-89 (ensure event compliance &amp; asset recovery.) | - CTL-649: event ROI measured with attribution rigor; portfolio reviewed quarterly; budget reallocated to ROI
Owner: Event Marketing Manager / Analytics (VS-28) / Finance (VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
